---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Discover GINZA"
  locale="en"
  description="How Discover GINZA handles personal information."
  canonicalPath="/en/privacy"
  alternatePath="/ja/privacy"
>
  <section class="policy">
    <header class="policy-header">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    </header>

    <p>
      GINZA WHISKERS (Ginza Showa Roman Club, "we") defines how personal
      information is handled on Discover GINZA (this site) as follows.
      Discover GINZA is a content and publishing media operated under the
      GINZA WHISKERS brand.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      This site does not currently provide a contact form or a published
      email address. For press, listing, or business inquiries, please use
      the contact channel on the GINZA WHISKERS brand site
      (<a href="https://ginzawhiskers.com/about.html">ginzawhiskers.com</a>).
    </p>

    <h2>2. Newsletter</h2>
    <p>
      We plan to introduce a newsletter feature in the future. It has not
      been implemented yet, and no email addresses are currently collected.
      When the feature launches, we will describe the information collected,
      its purpose, and how to unsubscribe in this policy before starting
      operation.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      We plan to use Google Analytics (GA4) to understand site usage and
      improve content. GA4 is an analytics tool provided by Google that uses
      cookies to collect usage data, processed in a way that does not
      identify individuals.
    </p>
    <p>
      We do not enable advertising features (such as Google Signals or
      linking data to a Google Ads account). As a result, usage data from
      this site is not shared with third parties for ad delivery or
      tracking purposes.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you do not wish your data to be collected by GA4, you can disable
      collection using Google's
      <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on
      </a>.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Social Media Integration (Instagram, etc.)</h2>
    <p>
      We use Meta's Graph API to publish content produced by Discover GINZA
      to our official social media accounts (including Instagram). This
      integration is used solely to post to accounts we manage, and does
      not collect or store personal Instagram or Facebook account
      information from visitors to this site. All publishing is reviewed
      and approved by a human before it goes out; we do not perform fully
      automated posting without human review.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Disclosure to Third Parties</h2>
    <p>
      We do not disclose collected information to third parties without
      consent, except where required by law.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>
      This policy may be revised without notice in response to changes in
      law or new site features (such as the newsletter or analytics
      tooling described above). Revisions take effect as soon as they are
      posted on this page.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Contact for This Policy</h2>
    <p>
      For questions about this policy, please use the
      <a href="https://ginzawhiskers.com/about.html">contact channel</a>
      on the GINZA WHISKERS brand site.
    </p>

    <p class="policy-date">Effective date: July 29, 2026</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .policy {
    max-width: 42rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 2rem 5rem;
  }
  .policy-header {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .policy-header h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }
  .policy p {
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }
  .policy h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin-top: 2.2em;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .policy a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .policy-date {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    margin-top: 2.5em;
  }
</style>
